OL,3,GNEWSAJoanna Lumley joins vigil for
OL,4,ANepal flood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FNepal's foreign ministry said 1,252
OL,7,Fdeaths had been recorded since the
OL,8,Fflood and 4,200 people remained
OL,9,Fmissing, including 590 foreign
OL,10,Fnationals.
